01:01:52,500 --> 01:01:58,500
BloodRayne 2: Deliverance (also known as BloodRayne 2 or BloodRayne: Deliverance) is a 2007
direct-to-DVD Western horror film set in 1880s America and directed by Uwe Boll.

11
01:08:03,750 --> 01:08:09,750
It is a sequel to the 2005 film BloodRayne, which was also
directed by Boll, and stars Kristanna Loken.

12
01:14:15,000 --> 01:14:21,000
In Deliverance, Natassia Malthe replaces Loken in the lead role.

13
01:20:26,250 --> 01:20:32,250
BloodRayne 2: Deliverance was released in the US on
September 18, 2007 and in Germany on November 30.

14
01:26:37,500 --> 01:26:43,500
Like its predecessor, the film received negative reviews from critics.

